Officers of the University

ORDINANCE LXXX OF 2002
UNIVERSITY OF
SARGODHA ORDINANCE, 2002
ORDINANCE LXXX OF
2002
An Ordinance to provide for the Establishment of the University of Sargodha
[Gazette of Punjab,
Extraordinary, 16th November, 2002]
No. Legis.13-59/2002, dated
16-11-2002.--The following Ordinance promulgated by the Governor of the
Punjab is hereby published for general information:
8. Officers of the
University.----The following shall be the officers of the University:---
(a) the-Chancellor;
(b) the Vice-Chancellor;
(c) the Deans;
(d) the Associate Deans;
(e) the Directors of Institute;
(f) the Principals of University
Colleges;
(g) the Chairmen of Academic
Departments;
(h) the Registrar;
(i) the Treasurer;
(j) the Controller of
Examinations;
(k) the Librarian; and
(l) such other persons as may be
prescribed to be officers.
